+/**
+ * @brief [Internal] Collapsed CQ: the single slot holds an error CQE. Record it, then tell whether
+ * cons_index failed (-EIO) or completed before the first recorded failure (0).
+ * The NIC overwrites the slot with the flush CQE of every WQE that was posted after the failed one,
+ * so the record holds the cause only if a poll ran before the first flush landed. Once a slot holds
+ * an error CQE it only ever holds error CQEs, so this never has to report "not ready".
+ */
